  "fullText": "To data type se matlab, kis tarah ka data variable store kar sakta hai? To integer ek type hota hai, float ek type hota hai, string ek type hota hai, boolean ek type hota hai. Aur ye data type ko represent karne ke liye Python mein koi alag se symbol nahi lagana padta hai. Python ka variable automatically samajh jaata hai ki ye kis tarah ka data type store kar raha hai.",
